INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `PageName`, `type`, `detail`, `admin_id`) VALUES
(1, 'Terms and Conditions', 'terms', '										<p align=\"justify\"><br></p><h3>1. <strong>Acceptance of Terms</strong></h3><p>By accessing and using our website, you agree to abide by these Terms and any applicable laws or regulations. We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time without prior notice. The latest version of these Terms will be posted on this page.</p><h3>2. <strong>User Registration and Account</strong></h3><p>To access certain features, such as renting a seat/room, buying or selling products, or managing meal records, you may be required to create an account. When registering:</p><ul><li>You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information.</li><li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities under your account.</li><li>You must notify us immediately if you suspect any unauthorized use of your account.</li></ul><h3>3. <strong>Use of Platform</strong></h3><p>You agree to use our platform for lawful purposes only. You may not:</p><ul><li>Engage in any activity that violates any laws or infringes on third-party rights.</li><li>Post or share any content that is illegal, harmful, offensive, or violates any intellectual property rights.</li><li>Use our platform to transmit malware, viruses, or any harmful code.</li><li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to other users\' accounts or our website’s backend.</li></ul><h3>4. <strong>Renting Seats/Rooms</strong></h3><p>When renting a seat or room, you agree to:</p><ul><li>Adhere to the terms and conditions set by the property owner.</li><li>Make payments in full as agreed upon during the booking process.</li><li>Follow any rules and regulations set by the landlord or property manager.</li></ul><h3>5. <strong>Buying and Selling Products</strong></h3><p>Users who buy or sell products on our platform agree to:</p><ul><li>Provide accurate descriptions and images of the products listed for sale.</li><li>Honor transactions that are completed via the platform.</li><li>Resolve any disputes directly with the other party involved in the transaction.</li></ul><h3>6. <strong>Meal Management</strong></h3><p>Users who utilize the meal management feature are responsible for logging accurate meal information and understanding that we do not guarantee the accuracy or nutritional value of meals logged. Meal tracking is for personal use only and should not be relied upon for medical or dietary decisions.</p><h3>7. <strong>Community Groups</strong></h3><p>When joining a community group, you agree to:</p><ul><li>Engage in respectful and constructive interactions with other members.</li><li>Not post any content that is abusive, offensive, or discriminatory.</li><li>Follow the guidelines established by each group, if applicable.</li></ul><h3>8. <strong>Privacy and Data Collection</strong></h3><p>Your use of the platform is governed by our Privacy Policy, which explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information. By using our platform, you consent to the collection and processing of your data as outlined in the Privacy Policy.</p><h3>9. <strong>Termination of Account</strong></h3><p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time if you violate these Terms or engage in behavior that we deem inappropriate. Upon termination, your access to certain features may be revoked, and any outstanding payments may be due immediately.</p><h3>10. <strong>Limitation of Liability</strong></h3><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, [Your Website Name] and its affiliates are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use or inability to use the platform, including any errors, interruptions, or loss of data.</p><h3>11. <strong>Indemnification</strong></h3><p>You agree to indemnify and hold [Your Website Name], its affiliates, employees, and agents harmless from any claims, losses, or damages, including legal fees, arising out of your use of the platform or violation of these Terms.</p><h3>12. <strong>Governing Law</strong></h3><p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Bangladesh. Any disputes arising from these Terms will be resolved in the courts located within Bangladeshi Law.</p><h3>13. <strong>Contact Information</strong></h3><p>If you have any questions or concerns about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:</p><p>Bachelor Blatform<br>Email: info@gmail.com<br>Phone:&nbsp;<a href=\"tel:01717117171\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(45, 204, 112); transition-duration: 0.5s; fill: rgb(45, 204, 112); outline: none; font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\">01717117171</a><br>Address:Sayednagar B Block, Dhaka</p><p><br></p>\r\n										', NULL),
(2, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy', '										<h3><strong>Information We Collect</strong></h3><p>We collect personal information in various ways, including when you sign up, create a profile, or interact with our services. The types of information we may collect include:</p><ul><li><strong>Personal Identifiable Information (PII):</strong> Name, email address, phone number, address, and payment details.</li><li><strong>Non-Personal Information:</strong> Browser type, device type, IP address, and usage data.</li></ul><h3><strong>How We Use Your Information</strong></h3><p>We use the information we collect for various purposes, including:</p><ul><li>To provide and improve our services.</li><li>To process transactions and manage bookings or purchases.</li><li>To communicate with you about your account, bookings, and promotions.</li><li>To improve user experience and provide personalized content.</li><li>To comply with legal obligations.</li></ul><h3><strong>Data Security</strong></h3><p>We take reasonable precautions to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. We use industry-standard encryption and security protocols to safeguard your data.</p><h3><strong>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</strong></h3><p>Our platform uses cookies and other tracking technologies to enhance your user experience. Cookies are small files stored on your device that help us understand how you interact with our website. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p><h3><strong>Sharing Your Information</strong></h3><p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your information with:</p><ul><li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Third-party vendors who assist in the operation of our platform.</li><li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> If required by law or legal processes, we may disclose your information to authorities.</li></ul><h3><strong>Your Choices and Rights</strong></h3><p>You have the right to:</p><ul><li>Access, update, or delete your personal information.</li><li>Opt out of promotional emails by using the unsubscribe link in emails.</li><li>Manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.</li></ul><h3><strong>Children’s Privacy</strong></h3><p>Our platform is not intended for users under the age of 15, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe we have collected information from a child, please contact us to have it removed.</p><h3><strong>Changes to This Privacy Policy</strong></h3><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page, and the “Effective Date” will be updated accordingly. Please review the Privacy Policy periodically for updates.</p><h3><strong>Contact Us</strong></h3><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at the contact us section, send your queries through the form .</p>\r\n										', NULL),
(3, 'About Us ', 'aboutus', '																																								<div><p><br></p>\r\n<p>Welcome to our platform, designed specifically to meet the unique needs of bachelors. We are a team of passionate individuals committed to making bachelor life easier, more convenient, and enjoyable. Our goal is to provide a comprehensive platform that not only addresses essential daily needs but also fosters a sense of community and connection.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are looking for a place to rent, a way to manage your meals and expenses, or a community of like-minded individuals, we have you covered. Our platform offers easy seat/room rentals, meal tracking, a marketplace for buying and selling products, and area-based community groups to help you stay connected with others around you.</p>\r\n<p>We understand the challenges bachelors face when it comes to managing their living situation, social life, and daily activities. That’s why we’ve designed our platform to be simple, intuitive, and accessible, so you can focus on what truly matters. With us, you can find comfort, savings, and a sense of belonging, all in one place.</p>\r\n<p>Join us today and experience a better, more organized bachelor life!</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><br></p></div>\r\n										\r\n										\r\n										\r\n										\r\n										', NULL),
(11, 'FAQs', 'faqs', '<p><strong>1. How do I rent a seat or room on your platform?</strong><br>To rent a seat or room, simply browse the available listings on our platform, select the one that fits your needs, and follow the booking process. You’ll need to create an account to confirm your booking.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Can I manage my meals on your platform?</strong><br>Yes! Our platform includes a meal management feature that lets you log and track your daily and monthly meals. You can calculate the costs and stay on top of your nutrition. This is especially helpful for budgeting your food&nbsp; and monthly expenses.</p><p><strong>3. How can I buy or sell products?</strong><br>To buy or sell products, just visit the Buy-Sell section of our platform. Sellers can list products by providing a description, images, and prices. Buyers can search and browse items by category . You can contact the seller directly through our platform’s messaging system.</p><p><strong>4. What are community groups, and how can I join one?</strong><br>Community groups are created based on your location, interests, or needs. They provide a space for bachelors in your area to connect, share experiences, and discuss local events. You can join a community group by simply signing up on our platform and joining groups relevant to your location or interests. You can also request to open a new comunity.</p><p><strong>5. Is my personal information secure on your platform?</strong><br>Absolutely! We take your privacy and security seriously. Our platform uses encryption and other security measures to ensure that your personal and payment information is protected.</p><p><strong>6. Can I edit or update my profile and listings?</strong><br>Yes, you can update your profile and listings at any time. Simply log in to your account, go to your profile or the listing section, and make the necessary changes.</p><p><strong>7. How can I contact customer support?</strong><br>If you have any issues or questions, you can contact our customer support team via the \"Contact Us\" section on our website. We’ll be happy to assist you.</p><p><strong>8. Is there a fee for using the platform?</strong><br>Basic use of the platform is free. However, there may be a small fee for certain premium features like advanced product listings or seat/room rentals. All fees are clearly displayed before you make a purchase or booking. You can subscribe us through subscription option.</p>', NULL);

